<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions for Cleaning Businesses</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        What should I include on a cleaning invoice?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        A cleaning invoice should include your business name, license/insurance number (if applicable), client details, service date and address, description of cleaning services (e.g., "standard residential cleaning – 3 bedrooms, 2 baths"), hourly rate or fixed fee, number of hours or square footage, supplies cost (cleaning products, equipment), any add-on services (carpet cleaning, window washing), taxes, deposit paid, balance due, and payment terms.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Is this cleaning invoice generator really free?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes! RatPDF's invoice generator is completely free for cleaning businesses. No hidden fees, subscriptions, or watermarks. Create unlimited invoices and download them as PDF files at no cost.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Can I bill by the hour or by the job?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Absolutely. You can set an hourly rate and enter estimated hours, or use a fixed price for the entire job. You can also mix both – for example, "Cleaning labor – 3 hours  $35/hr" plus "Carpet cleaning add-on – $75 fixed".
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        Does it support recurring cleaning invoices (weekly, monthly)?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes. You can create individual invoices for each occurrence, or use the same template each week/month. While we don't auto-send recurring invoices (to keep it simple and free), you can quickly duplicate your previous invoice each billing cycle.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Do I need to create an account to generate invoices?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account or sign-up is required. Start creating invoices immediately – we don't store any of your data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

